        <mxCell id="uc1" value="&lt;b&gt;UC1 — Certified Question:&lt;/b&gt;  Ask Page → live_router_service → Model Serving (VS ① + Judge ② = MATCH ③) → certified_lane_service → LLM (extract params) → SQL Warehouse → &lt;font color=&quot;#82B366&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Badge: Certified ✓&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
