        <mxCell id="uc2" value="&lt;b&gt;UC2 — Analytical Question:&lt;/b&gt;  Ask Page → live_router_service → Model Serving (VS ① + Judge ② = NO_MATCH ③) → genie_service → Genie Space (dynamic SQL) → &lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Badge: Not Certified&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
