        <mxCell id="uc3" value="&lt;b&gt;UC3 — Certification Flywheel:&lt;/b&gt;  User &quot;Add to Review&quot; → submit_draft → SME Review → Edit SQL → Run Query → Certify (EXPLAIN validates) → INSERT corpus → sync_index() → &lt;b&gt;Next match routes certified&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
